# Hearth UI theme

Living theme authority: `docs/HEARTH_UI_THEME.md`. Implementation packet: `docs/briefs/CURSOR_UI_THEME_PACKET.md`.

## Locked shells

- Mobile `<720px`: **Draft C** — wax seals, story strip, notebook expand, Duolingo Hercules focus/unfocus.
- Desktop `≥720px`: **Draft D** — first mock stylized room + Hercules wander pathing; Calendar/Books in same room.

## Before any UI change

1. Reuse paper tile / seal / notebook grammar; do not invent new card systems.
2. Use `:root` tokens only; Figtree + Fraunces; sentence-case finance labels.
3. Never cover Confirm/Post; never put CAD on weather; never shrink desktop to match phone.
4. Hercules: Maine Coon; mobile pill until focus; desktop ever-present wanderer.
5. Verify 320/390/720/~1100px, reduced motion, 44px targets, expand a11y.
6. Name Budget delta (5) and Engagement delta (3); books win on conflict.
